# An allowlist: nothing enters the image unless it is named here. This is what
# keeps .env (production Jira credentials), data/, docs/evidence/ (real Jira
# data) and anything dropped in the folder (zips, decks) out of the image. Only
# what runs in the image is listed.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!.env.sample
!main.py
!web.py
!pmagent/
# the entrypoint and the scripts it runs (the rest need a browser or a checkout)
!scripts/__init__.py
!scripts/container.py
!scripts/demo_web.py
!scripts/smoke.py
# the course examples, including lesson 8's MCP server
!docs/learning/examples/
# the scripted model: the demo and the examples replay through it
!tests/__init__.py
!tests/fakes.py

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
# real budget rows, and a provenance note naming the source machine
pmagent/tools/fy_budget/fixtures/
pmagent/tools/fy_budget/PROVENANCE.md
